INFOGUIDE :
Infoguide is part of a small construction company based in Western Australia and this app was created by a former carpenter for our team of carpenters. We use it and believe it will be as useful to other carpenters as it has been to us.

LandCalc is THE app for busy professional landscapers and gardeners. It has been designed by those in the trade who wanted a reliable and accurate calculator for all the calculations required for submitting quotes to clients.

The LandCalc calculator is several calculators in one! The LandCalc calculator will give you:
soil and mulch quantities;
block quantities (and total costs) for garden beds or retaining walls;
pavers and stepping stone quantities;
soil quantities for pots and planters;
employee hours worked; and
a tax calculator that works for any country.

Although Landcalc was primarily designed for landscape gardeners, it is also useful for any DIY gardeners or those who wish to complete a DIY gardening project.

Landcalc will definitely save you time in calculating quantities for those landscape and gardening jobs. As we all know, saving time means saving money!
